  "raw_character_count": 1405,
  "raw_text": "# Job Description: Junior AI/ML Engineer\n\n**Company:** TechNova Solutions  \n**Location:** Kochi, Kerala, India  \n**Experience:** Fresher / 0–1 year  \n**Employment Type:** Full-time\n\n## Job Summary\nWe are looking for a motivated Junior AI/ML Engineer to join our team. The candidate will help develop machine learning models, process datasets, and build AI-powered applications.\n\n## Responsibilities\n- Develop and test machine learning models using Python.\n- Clean, preprocess, and analyze datasets using Pandas and NumPy.\n- Apply machine learning algorithms using Scikit-learn.\n- Work on Natural Language Processing (NLP) and text classification tasks.\n- Explore Generative AI, Large Language Models, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).\n- Collaborate with team members to improve model performance.\n- Document experiments, results, and project workflows.\n\n## Required Skills\n- Python programming\n- Machine Learning fundamentals\n- Pandas and NumPy\n- Scikit-learn\n- Data preprocessing and exploratory data analysis\n- Basic statistics\n- Problem-solving and analytical thinking\n- Git and GitHub\n\n## Preferred Skills\n- NLP and text processing\n- Sentence Transformers and semantic similarity\n- Streamlit application development\n- Generative AI and LLM basics\n- SQL fundamentals\n\n## Education\nBachelor's degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Information Technology, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science"
}